OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major bridge in Kyiv has been
OL,8,Ftargeted by Russian strikes for the
OL,9,Fsecond day in a row, coinciding with a
OL,10,Fsurprise visit from German Chancellor
OL,11,FFriedrich Merz's to the city.
OL,13,FThe Pivnichnyi (Northern) Bridge was
OL,14,Fhit on Sunday morning, a day after it
OL,15,Fwas first struck by drones in an attack
OL,16,Fthat damaged the road surface and led
OL,17,Fto traffic disruption.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
