OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FKyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko said
OL,8,FSunday's strike had also damaged a
OL,9,Fheating main, adding that there would
OL,10,Fbe a temporary lack of hot water in the
OL,11,Fnorth-eastern Desnyanskyi district as a
OL,12,Fresult.
OL,14,FMajor bridges have been targeted in
OL,15,FKyiv over the past four days as Moscow
OL,16,Framps up attacks on critical
OL,17,Finfrastructure in the capital.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
